  "ingredients": [
    "nonstick cooking spray",
    "10 russet potatoes, peeled and cubed",
    "1/2 cup whole milk",
    "1 teaspoon butter, softened",
    "salt to taste",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground black pepper",
    "1/2 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "2 cups shredded Cheddar cheese, divided",
    "1 (8 ounce) container sour cream",
    "1 (8 ounce) package cream cheese",
    "8 strips bacon, crisp cooked and crumbled",
    "2 tablespoons chopped chives"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather ingredients. Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish with nonstick cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jdpm9LZ00HBmS-_-CT2INn2hmgk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231988-twice-baked-potato-casserole-mfs-4x3-step-01-e2c8ef5ff6bf4071927f89bee3dc25ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256027/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potatoes into a large pot and cover with salted water; bring to a boil. Reduce heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 15 minutes. Drain and return to the pot.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eXnoAYK46v6Jt6y9uBfv3VhfmCk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231988-twice-baked-potato-casserole-mfs-4x3-step-03-48a62abe5e0b42f98b4cd1b78cd0db39.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256027/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add milk, butter, salt, pepper, and garlic powder to the potatoes; mash until nearly smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/znVl8orI-3UK0CI-VTc_lpJVSfw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231988-twice-baked-potato-casserole-mfs-4x3-step-04-4532edf6920645a0a8bec79f8183715c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256027/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in 1 1/2 cups Cheddar cheese, sour cream, cream cheese, 3/4 of the bacon, and 2 tablespoons of chives. Spread potato mixture in the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/DK0NrisHna4JYZJKUqSOWqHp8D4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231988-twice-baked-potato-casserole-mfs-4x3-step-06-e2982d655aa44bbbb71cec13bade5548.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256027/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until heated through, about 20 minutes. Sprinkle remaining 1/2 cup Cheddar cheese on top; continue baking until cheese is melted, 5 to 10 minutes more. Garnish with remaining bacon and chives.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Yw0Z9zbMOLroUb2nyZlbgfklvU8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/231988-twice-baked-potato-casserole-mfs-4x3-step-08-5f705f1d48eb4fb481f613ccd44bb34b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/256027/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
